<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Land cuts CP conversion price.</title>
<headline>Ayala Land cuts CP conversion price.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The conversion price of Ayala Land Inc's convertible long-term commercial paper has been reduced to 27.80 pesos per share from 34.75 due to the 25 percent stock dividend, underwriters said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>AB Capital and Investment Corp and BPI Capital Corp, in a joint letter, said the price adjustment was effected April 28, when Ayala went ex-dividend.</p>
<p>The new price was adjusted to cover the dilution effect of the stock dividend.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
